Job Title: Sr. Business Analyst
Location: Richmond, VA (Hybrid – 4 Days Onsite, 1 Day Remote)
Duration: 8 Months

Interview: In-Person Only
Job Description
We are seeking an experienced Senior Business Analyst with strong expertise in business and systems analysis, requirements gathering, SDLC, Agile/Scrum, business process mapping, and manual testing of web applications.
Key Responsibilities
Gather, analyze, and document business and system requirements.
Develop SDLC-compliant requirements documentation and process workflows.
Collaborate with business stakeholders and development teams during Agile/Scrum meetings.
Create and execute test plans and scripts; perform manual web application testing.
Identify, document, and track application defects.
Support User Acceptance Testing (UAT) and document project decisions.
Required Qualifications
Minimum 8 years of experience in business/systems analysis, requirements documentation, SDLC, Agile/Scrum, and business process improvement.
Strong experience in requirements elicitation, process mapping, and complex system testing.
Experience creating test plans, conducting meetings, and documenting project decisions.
Excellent communication, analytical, and documentation skills.
Preferred Qualifications
2+ years of familiarity with .NET web application development.
2+ years of familiarity with Microsoft Team Foundation Server (TFS).
Important Notes
Local Richmond-area candidates preferred.
Four days onsite and one day remote per week.
In-person interview is mandatory.
First-day office visit required for equipment and badge activation.
Contractor parking is not provided.

